a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">Art Deco Hexagon Halo RG</a></td><td>$4,175</td><td>$6,387</td><td>Statement 1920s hexagon. See <a href="/2-carat-marquise-diamond-price">2ct guide</a>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2.5ct marquise</strong></td><td>~$3,283 lab</td><td>~$34,151 natural</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/romantic-diamond-floral-halo-engagement-ring-in-platinum-1-2-ct-tw-item-150342?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">Romantic Floral Halo Platinum</a></td><td>$5,280</td><td>$8,563</td><td>Statement + lifetime platinum. See <a href="/2-5-carat-marquise-diamond-price">2.5ct guide</a>.</td></tr></tbody></table>

**Verdict:** Art Deco scales across every centre carat tier. The $1,650 Marquise Accents + 1ct lab centre at $2,250 is the sharpest-value Art Deco entry. The $3,440 Vintage Baguette Halo Platinum delivers period-correct Art Deco at 1.5ct. The $4,175 Art Deco Hexagon Halo delivers 1920s hexagon geometry at 2ct. Above that, Floral Halo scales as a statement piece.

